`io.fs` ⊂ `audio.fs` stays ambiguous. Extract-and-keep is identity.
The token may refuse.

resolve refuses path:line. Missing --from/--to refs exit 2.
Corrupt tokens exit 1. Origin mismatch exits 1 unless --any-repo.
